OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain, heavy
OL,6,Fat times, will move eastwards across
OL,7,Fthe region through the evening.
OL,8,FStaying cloudy overnight, with further
OL,9,Fspells of light rain and drizzle. A
OL,10,Fmild night with temperatures holding
OL,11,Fup in the double figures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FBrightening up, after a
OL,14,Fcloudy and damp start, with sunny
OL,15,Fspells and a scattering of showers.
OL,16,FShowers heaviest and most frequent in
OL,17,Fthe north and west. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
