OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and showers expected throughout
OL,7,Fthis period. Some of the showers will
OL,8,Fbe heavy and times, with the risk of
OL,9,Fhail and thunder. A fresh feel for all.
